cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Nerve Edge Decision, please cite it as below."
title: "Nerve Edge Decision: a runtime monitor for INT8 neural networks at the edge"
abstract: >-
  Nerve Edge Decision watches a small INT8 convolutional network deployed with ONNX
  Runtime. It flags inputs unlike the training data (sensor faults, foreign
  scenes) and bit flips in the quantised weights, and it reports its own
  costs: accuracy lost to quantisation, detection rates, latency and memory.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mocanu
    given-names: Jolan
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JolanMc/nerve-edge-decision"
keywords:
  - edge AI
  - INT8 quantisation
  - out-of-distribution detection
  - runtime monitoring
  - fault injection
  - single-event upset
  - Earth observation
  - ONNX Runtime
